[en.FOCUS_C08_EASTERN_FIRE]
Flames of the East

[en.FOCUS_C08_EASTERN_FIRE_desc]
We have broken out of the siege and shone the light of liberation on Eastern Equestria, rescuing the ponies from the darkness of slave trade.\n\nThis is the beginning of liberation, not the end. The whole world will eventually understand and make their choice between the usurper and the orthodox successor of Equestria!

[en.FOCUS_C08_EASTERN_FIRE_TOOLTIP]
§YResistance§! will be reorganized into §YLiberation Front§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_EASTERN_FIRE]
东方星火

[zh.FOCUS_C08_EASTERN_FIRE_desc]
我们从绝境中突围而出，将解放的光芒照向了东小马利亚，将小马们从奴隶贸易的黑暗中解救出来。\n\n这是解放的开始，不会是解放的终结。全世界都将知道，哪一方是谋权篡位、非法统治的小马，哪一方是小马利亚的正统政权！

[zh.FOCUS_C08_EASTERN_FIRE_TOOLTIP]
§Y抵抗军§!将改组为§Y解放阵线§!

